      ],
      "blocks": {
        "faq_question_CjYCMz": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Yes! Clear Protein+ was designed to be a daily ritual. It supports your protein, collagen, and hydration needs with clean ingredients your body can actually use.</p>",
            "title": "Can I take Clear Protein+ every day?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_GJbdXA": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>None! Clear Protein+ is sugar-free with no stevia, sucralose, or artificial sweeteners. It’s lightly sweetened with OnoSweet (a naturally fermented Reb M sourced from rice) for a refreshing, balanced taste.</p>",
            "title": "Does it contain any sugar or artificial sweeteners?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_GXb7nn": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! With 10g of protein and all 9 essential amino acids plus electrolytes, it helps fuel muscle recovery and hydration<strong> </strong>without the heaviness of a post-workout shake.</p>",
            "title": "Is it suitable for post-workout recovery?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_TAW4Nx": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Clear Protein+ is best mixed with room temperature water first, then topped with ice for the most refreshing taste and smoothest experience. You can also mix it with sparkling water for a fun twist. While it can be added to other beverages, it's not designed to be mixed with milk.</p>",
            "title": "Can I mix it with something other than water?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_h6nPM6": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>“Clear protein” refers to a type of protein powder that dissolves into a light, juice-like drink instead of a thick, milky shake. Our refreshing raspberry yuzu clear protein is made from a blend of collagen peptides and essential amino acids that are easy to digest- making it perfect for people who want the benefits of protein without the heaviness of traditional protein powders.</p>",
            "title": "What does “clear protein” actually mean?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_t9JU4a": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Crisp raspberry with a citrusy hint of citrusy yuzu fruit. It’s light, fruity and tastes delicious!</p>",
            "title": "What does it taste like?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_xEqHrR": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Most protein powders are thick, milky, and hard to digest. They can leave you feeling heavy, bloated, or uncomfortable—not to mention the hassle of blenders, scoops, and cleanup.</p><p>Clear Protein+ changes that. Our innovative formula combines collagen with essential amino acids to create a complete amino acid profile that supports muscle strength, healthy skin, and joint health. We also added electrolytes to help support hydration, all in one light, refreshing drink that mixes in seconds.</p><p>Just clean, high-quality ingredients that make hitting your protein goals on the go easy.</p>",
            "title": "What makes this different from other protein powders?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        }
      },
      "name": "FAQ",
      "settings": {
